  "is_special_feature": true,
  "review": "<h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-stone-900 border-b-2 border-amber-500 pb-2 mb-4\">【2026年最新】都城・えびの高原おすすめ宿10選！日本一の宮崎牛＆霧島連山秘湯</h2>\n<p class=\"text-xs text-stone-700 leading-relaxed my-2\">ふるさと納税日本一の肉と焼酎のまち「都城」。最高峰の黒毛和牛「宮崎牛」。名瀑「関之尾滝の甌穴群」。雄大な霧島連山に抱かれた「えびの高原」、そして宮崎最古のいで湯「京町温泉」。</p>\n<p class=\"text-xs text-stone-700 leading-relaxed my-2\">宮崎内陸部（都城・えびの）エリアの立地を整理し、<strong>「清流露天風呂付き宮崎牛名宿・駅前快適ホテル・京町温泉」で絶対に失敗しない厳選10選</strong>の魅力と見どころを紹介します。！</p>\n<h2 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-stone-900 border-b border-amber-300 pb-2 my-6 flex items-center gap-2\">🗺️ 都城・えびのエリアの距離感マップ</h2>\n<div class=\"my-4 p-4 bg-stone-900 text-amber-300 font-mono text-xs rounded-2xl overflow-x-auto shadow-inner leading-relaxed\"><pre>【えびの高原・京町温泉】（京町温泉 十兵衛の宿）\n      │\n      │ 国道221号・宮崎道:車で約40分\n      ▼\n【都城市街・都城駅】（常盤荘・ベッセルホテル都城・都城グリーンホテル）\n      │\n      └── (宮崎道:車で約50分 / JR特急きりしま約50分) ──▶ 【宮崎市街・宮崎空港】</pre></div>\n<li class=\"text-xs text-stone-700 ml-4 list-disc my-1\"><strong>鹿児島空港 ⇔ 都城</strong>: 高速バスで約50分 / 車で約40分</li>\n<li class=\"text-xs text-stone-700 ml-4 list-disc my-1\"><strong>宮崎空港 ⇔ 都城</strong>: 車で約50分</li>\n<h2 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-stone-900 border-b border-amber-300 pb-2 my-6 flex items-center gap-2\">🏆 都城・えびの：後悔回避の厳選10選</h2>\n<div class=\"my-8 p-6 rounded-3xl bg-white border border-amber-200/90 shadow-md hover:shadow-lg transition duration-300\">\n\n        <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-b border-amber-100 pb-3 mb-4\">\n          <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n            <span class=\"px-3 py-1 bg-amber-500 text-white font-black text-xs rounded-lg\">厳選名宿</span>\n            <h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-stone-900\">1. 常盤荘（都城市山田町・霧島山麓）</h3>\n          </div>\n          <span class=\"px-2.5 py-0.5 bg-amber-100 text-amber-800 font-extrabold text-xs rounded-full\">⭐ 4.51</span>\n        </div>\n      \n\n          <div class=\"mb-4\">\n            <img src=\"https://img.travel.rakuten.co.jp/share/HOTEL/70657/70657.jpg\" alt=\"常盤荘 施設外観・客室\" class=\"w-full h-52 object-cover rounded-2xl border border-stone-200 shadow-sm\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n          </div>\n        \n<p class=\"text-xs text-stone-700 leading-relaxed my-2\"><strong>〜清流沿いに佇む離れ宿！全室半露天風呂付き客室と日本一の都城宮崎牛会席〜</strong></p>\n<h4 class=\"text-xs px-3 py-1.5 rounded-xl border mt-3.5 mb-1.5 inline-block text-amber-900 bg-amber-50/80 border-amber-200 font-bold\">① どんな旅行に向いている宿か</h4>\n<p class=\"text-xs text-stone-700 leading-relaxed my-2\">宮崎牛美食家、温泉通、ご夫婦、記念日。</p>\n<h4 class=\"text-xs px-3 py-1.5 rounded-xl border mt-3.5 mb-1.5 inline-block text-emerald-900 bg-emerald-50 border-emerald-300 font-black\">⑦ 「だから、この旅行ならここ」</h4>\n<p class=\"text-xs text-stone-700 leading-relaxed my-2\"><strong>「本場の最高峰宮崎牛と霧島山麓の静かな清流温泉離れを満喫するなら迷わずここ！」</strong></p>\n<h4 class=\"text-xs px-3 py-1.5 rounded-xl border mt-3.5 mb-1.5 inline-block text-amber-900 bg-amber-50/80 border-amber-200 font-bold\">⑧ 楽天トラベルで空室・料金を確認</h4>\n\n        <div class=\"pt-4 text-center\">\n          <a href=\"https://hb.afl.rakuten.co.jp/hgc/54d2a438.4bc4abc2.54d2a439.aa1be583/?pc=https%3A%2F%2Ftravel.rakuten.co.jp%2FHOTEL%2F70657%2F70657.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"inline-block w-full md:w-auto px-8 py-3.5 bg-gradient-to-r from-amber-500 via-amber-600 to-orange-500 text-white font-black text-xs rounded-2xl shadow-md hover:scale-105 transition transform\">\n            ✈️ 【公式楽天トラベル】常盤荘 の最新空室・限定お得プランを見る\n          </a>\n        </div>\n      \n</div>\n<div class=\"my-8 p-6 rounded-3xl bg-white border border-amber-200/90 shadow-md hover:shadow-lg transition duration-300\">\n\n        <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-b border-amber-100 pb-3 mb-4\">\n          <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n            <span class=\"px-3 py-1 bg-amber-500 text-white font-black text-xs rounded-lg\">厳選名宿</span>\n            <h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-stone-900\">2. ベッセルホテル都城（都城市・都城IC車10分）</h3>\n          </div>\n          <span class=\"px-2.5 py-0.5 bg-amber-100 text-amber-800 font-extrabold text-xs rounded-full\">⭐ 4.48</span>\n        </div>\n      \n\n          <div class=\"mb-4\">\n            <img src=\"https://img.travel.rakuten.co.jp/share/HOTEL/68633/68633.jpg\" alt=\"ベッセルホテル都城 施設外観・客室\" class=\"w-full h-52 object-cover rounded-2xl border border-stone-200 shadow-sm\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n          </div>\n        \n<p class=\"text-xs text-stone-700 leading-relaxed my-2\"><strong>〜広々客室＆18歳以下添い寝無料！充実の無料朝食バイキングホテル〜</strong></p>\n<h4 class=\"text-xs px-3 py-1.5 rounded-xl border mt-3.5 mb-1.5 inline-block text-amber-900 bg-amber-50/80 border-amber-200 font-bold\">① どんな旅行に向いている宿か</h4>\n<p class=\"text-xs text-stone-700 leading-relaxed my-2\">ファミリー、ビジネス＋観光、車旅行。</p>\n<h4 class=\"text-xs px-3 py-1.5 rounded-xl border mt-3.5 mb-1.5 inline-block text-emerald-900 bg-emerald-50 border-emerald-300 font-black\">⑦ 「だから、この旅行ならここ」</h4>\n<p class=\"text-xs text-stone-700 leading-relaxed my-2\"><strong>「都城で広々ベッドと美味しい朝食をお得に楽しむならここ！」</strong></p>\n<h4 class=\"text-xs px-3 py-1.5 rounded-xl border mt-3.5 mb-1.5 inline-block text-amber-900 bg-amber-50/80 border-amber-200 font-bold\">⑧ 楽天トラベルで空室・料金を確認</h4>\n\n        <div class=\"pt-4 text-center\">\n          <a href=\"https://hb.afl.rakuten.co.jp/hgc/54d2a438.4bc4abc2.54d2a439.aa1be583/?pc=https%3A%2F%2Ftravel.rakuten.co.jp%2FHOTEL%2F68633%2F68633.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"inline-block w-full md:w-auto px-8 py-3.5 bg-gradient-to-r from-amber-500 via-amber-600 to-orange-500 text-white font-black text-xs rounded-2xl shadow-md hover:scale-105 transition transform\">\n            ✈️ 【公式楽天トラベル】ベッセルホテル都城 の最新空室・限定お得プランを見る\n          </a>\n        </div>\n      \n</div>\n<div class=\"my-8 p-6 rounded-3xl bg-white border border-amber-200/90 shadow-md hover:shadow-lg transition duration-300\">\n\n        <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-b border-amber-100 pb-3 mb-4\">\n          <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">